<title>USA: Lone Star Intl to retire 3.4 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Lone Star Intl to retire 3.4 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>WEATHERFORD, Texas 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lone Star International Energy Inc said Monday it was retiring 3.4 million of its common shares.</p>
<p>With the retirement of the shares, the company's issued and outstanding common stock will decline to 16,465,283 shares, it said.</p>
